# This build has an intentionally tiny allowlist. Ignored local credentials and
# multi-gigabyte Rust build trees must never enter the Docker daemon's context.
**
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/
!src/**
!deploy/
!deploy/macos-validator/
!deploy/macos-validator/Caddy.Dockerfile
!deploy/macos-validator/Dockerfile
!deploy/macos-validator/container-entrypoint.sh

# Defense in depth for ignored files accidentally placed below an allowed path.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.bittensor/
**/wallets/
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.p12
**/*.pem
**/*.pfx
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd
**/*.egg-info/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/build/
**/target/
